      "content": "Do",
      "line_start": 13,
      "line_end": 13,
      "truncated": false
    },
    {
      "source_uri": "file:///Users/scemac/My_github/Aegis/knowledge/techniques/cards/crypto-rsa-common-modulus.md",
      "source_kind": "local_document",
      "verified": false,
      "action_policy": "none",
      "source_digest": "sha256:cbef649bdf275072e89ff1383a2de0592a0712a29c5ad4b5deda09fcaf53044e",
      "compiler_version": "1.0.0",
      "kind": "list",
      "topic": "RSA 共模攻击（同一 n，多组 e）",
      "section": [
        "RSA 共模攻击（同一 n，多组 e）",
        "Do"
      ],
      "content": "1. 确认 n 相同且 gcd(e1,e2)=1；若 gcd>1，先约分或换一对。\n2. 用扩展欧几里得求 a,b 使 a*e1+b*e2=1。\n3. m = c1^a * c2^b mod n；负指数用模逆（pow(c,-1,n)）。\n4. 把 m 转 bytes，检查可打印/结构（JSON、flag 格式、padding）。",
      "line_start": 14,
      "line_end": 17,
      "truncated": false
    },
